/Title (Our project aims to develop a smart indoor service robot that can assist people by carrying and delivering small items within offices, laboratories, or institutional environments. The robot will move autonomously along a fixed route, safely respond to obstacles, and deliver items to the intended person or location. The main goal is to reduce the time and effort required for repetitive indoor delivery tasks and make everyday service activities more convenient, organized, and efficient.)
